{"id":619,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"社会性と理数の素養を育む六年一貫教育","feature_description":"開明は、学習、行事、クラブ活動を通じて社会性を育み、将来のリーダーとして活躍する人を目指す中高一貫校です。理数の素養と情報化社会に対応する力を重視し、幅広い学びを通じて論理的に考える力を養います。国際的な視野、他者への思いやり、健全な生活習慣を大切にし、仲間と関わりながら自らの目標に向けて努力する姿勢を育てます。未来につながる学びを進めます。","clubs":[{"id":11598,"name":"生物部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_hs","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11599,"name":"将棋部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_hs","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11600,"name":"美術部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_hs","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11601,"name":"ＥＳＳ部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_hs","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11602,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_hs","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11603,"name":"合唱部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_hs","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11604,"name":"家庭科部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_hs","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11605,"name":"クラシック音楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_hs","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11606,"name":"かるた部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_hs","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11607,"name":"クイズ研究部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_hs","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11608,"name":"文芸部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_hs","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11609,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_hs","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11610,"name":"インターアクト部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_hs","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11611,"name":"情報工学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei.ed.jp/life_hs","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11612,"name":"写真部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://kaimei